                        "glosses": [
                            "Scandinavian; from or pertaining to Scandinavia."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal",
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee206f6f-1c31-4722-95ef-1c8603c4560b",
                                "sense_id": "03284a96-1a25-31ca-9670-623fcd3fd16b",
                                "text": "Longstanding maritime traditions and extensive coastlines mean that seafood also plays a major role in Scandi cuisine, and in my baking."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4e053128-d047-4626-b8ff-451b202c8902",
                                "sense_id": "03284a96-1a25-31ca-9670-623fcd3fd16b",
                                "text": "When it comes to fictional accounts, and notwithstanding the current 'Scandi Crime' trend following in the wake of Stieg Larsson's Millennium trilogy, Norwegian viewers have predominantly been exposed to Anglo-American programming."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "11a4fbbd-33d8-4324-bb29-3e72ff4f0905",
                                "sense_id": "03284a96-1a25-31ca-9670-623fcd3fd16b",
                                "text": "Things start encouragingly enough with attractive redbrick mansion blocks and municipal buildings, cobbled streets and interesting boutiques nestled between big high street stalwarts. The place looks a lot like a Scandi version of Guildford."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "791bc236-95b7-4767-a5c5-e2bf5681c7ee",
                                "sense_id": "03284a96-1a25-31ca-9670-623fcd3fd16b",
                                "text": "Rivalry with other middle-market brands competing for shoppers’ hard-earned cash has been ferocious, thanks to the likes of Me+Em, Rixo and Kitri, as well as the continued onslaught of chic Scandi brands such as & Other Stories, Arket, Cos and the more expensive Ganni."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
